From 3381155f49eca9af1b8148e72e451cc9b53b1d7b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Edwin Moquete <edwinmmoquete@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Oct 2025 20:09:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sdm845: Label discard_max_bytes sysfs

Change-Id: Ia6cd30c93376e07a8d78ed16c56106f423ead292
